Smith and Ira,

thank you very much for the great summary and for forwarding it to the 
printing-architecture mailing list.

There are two small mistakes:

1. It must read "Google Season of Docs" not "Google Summer of Docs"

2. "... noting that it supports 4000 models based on PPDs from 
gutenprint and hplip."

-->

"... noting that it supports 4000 models based on PPDs from Foomatic and 
HPLIP."

Note that the PPDs come from Foomatic and HPLIP. My Printer Application 
only supports PostScript printers. Gutenprint does not support 
PostScript printers and it is also planned to create a native Printer 
Application for Gutenprint.

    Till


